# Pre-commit — FAST (~2s) and low-friction, by design.
#
# 1. lint-staged (eslint --fix + prettier) — NON-BLOCKING.
#    A slow or blocking hook is how people learn to pass --no-verify.
# 2. check-single-lockfile — BLOCKING. ~50ms, deterministic, no false positives.
#
# The heavy typecheck (~30s) is deliberately left out: it is a MERGE gate, not a
# commit gate. Gates at the exit door, not at every step.

npx lint-staged || echo "⚠ eslint: erros residuais — commit segue; rode 'npm run lint'"
node scripts/check-single-lockfile.mjs
